        "title": "Enable safe graph growth and reorganization",
        "nextAction": "Define the bounded collection projection contract: load collection identity and index metadata first, then fetch a stable cursor-based page of member references with filtering and sorting instead of materializing the full membership graph.",
        "progressNote": "Audit complete. Author-directed promotion, portal replacement, stable source ownership, optional sections and summaries, and archive partitions are already established graph practices. The Elements panel virtualizes long rendered lists, but graph loading still materializes the complete .node payload before browsing. The missing capability is bounded collection projection, not another authoring threshold.",
