      "data": {
        "markdown": "# Suggested Sequence\n\n## Phase 1\n- define section/header grammar\n- define edge meaning by graph role\n- name canonical graph shapes\n\n## Phase 2\n- test the law against `/tasks/root.node`, the task template, and the template gallery\n- decide when summary surfaces should replace plain navigation ports\n\n## Phase 3\n- document reusable organization patterns for agents and humans",
